<title>UK: Hambro Countrywide has over 80 pct of RPT.</title>
<headline>Hambro Countrywide has over 80 pct of RPT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK estate agency Hambro Countrywide Plc said on Monday it had received acceptances representing about 80.5 percent of RPT Management's ordinary shares under its recommended offer for the property manager. Hambro said it extended its offer, which values RPT's share capital at about 8.4 million stg, until December 27.</p>
<p>By 1500 GMT on Friday, Hambro had valid acceptances covering about 5.9 million RPT ordinary shares, the company said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
